# FOSSIL FEUD: the Slate Flock's turn plays out step by step on the same
# rules: it prays (its Ancestor rests too), takes its blessings, and works
# through the three actions; its music while it thinks, the battle tune
# when it attacks. The three moults are three planners, each sharper.
seed 3
game fossilfeud
wait 10
# when it marches on our birds, a battle, and the battle music
cheat match 0
wait 2
cheat clearboard
cheat own 6 1
cheat units 6 30 0 0 0 0
cheat units 5 1 0 0 0 0
cheat own 10 0
cheat ai 2
cheat endturn
cheat offer 0 1 3
waituntil state == 5 3000
expect b_atk == 1
expect playing_battle == 1
waituntil state == 4 6000
expect t5_owner == 1

# a new match against the full plume
cheat match 2
wait 20
expect ai_level == 2
press A
cheat offer 2 0 1
wait 12
press A
wait 10
press A
press B
press B
expect side == 1
expect playing_rival == 1
waituntil mp == 4 200
waituntil side == 0 6000
expect recent1 == 2
# a few rounds on: the Slate Flock has spread out and prayed every turn
cheat ai 2
botuntil turn >= 12 60000
expect tiles1 >= 3
expect army1 >= 4
